free-exercise-db
===============

Source: https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db
Data file: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/main/dist/exercises.json
License: The Unlicense (public domain dedication)
License text: https://github.com/yuhonas/free-exercise-db/blob/main/LICENSE.md

The `exercises.json` file and the first image for each exercise are
included here for the Dyno Fitness training library seed. Exercise
images remain attributable to the free-exercise-db project; no
openGym assets or code are used.
